sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Upstream Gateway<br/>(Kuadrant/Authorino)
    participant API as API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>TCP
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>TCP
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Proc as Processor<br/>StatefulSet
    participant LLMd as llm-d Gateway<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant GC as Garbage Collector
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,K8s: Flow 1: Batch Job Submission

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/files<br/>Auth: API Key / SA Token
    Gateway->>API: Forward + X-MaaS-Username header
    API->>S3: Upload input file<br/>AWS credentials
    API->>PG: Store file metadata<br/>Tenant-scoped
    API-->>Gateway: File ID
    Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK + File ID

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/batches<br/>input_file_id, model, endpoint
    Gateway->>API: Forward + X-MaaS-Username header
    API->>PG: Create batch job record<br/>Tenant-scoped
    API->>S3: Validate input file exists
    API->>Redis: Enqueue job to priority queue
    API-->>Gateway: Batch ID + status: validating
    Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK + Batch ID

    Note over Client,K8s: Flow 2: Batch Job Processing

    Proc->>Redis: Poll priority queue<br/>(interval: 5s)
    Redis-->>Proc: Dequeue job
    Proc->>PG: Load batch job details
    Proc->>S3: Download input file
    S3-->>Proc: JSONL batch requests

    loop For each request (AIMD concurrency controlled)
        Proc->>LLMd: POST inference request<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+ / mTLS
        LLMd-->>Proc: Inference response
    end

    Proc->>S3: Upload output file<br/>JSONL results
    Proc->>PG: Update batch status: completed
    Proc->>Redis: Publish completion event

    Note over Client,K8s: Flow 3: Status Check & Result Retrieval

    Client->>Gateway: GET /v1/batches/{batch_id}
    Gateway->>API: Forward + X-MaaS-Username
    API->>PG: Query batch status<br/>Tenant-scoped
    API-->>Client: Batch status + progress

    Client->>Gateway: GET /v1/files/{output_file_id}/content
    Gateway->>API: Forward + X-MaaS-Username
    API->>S3: Download output file
    API-->>Client: JSONL results

    Note over Client,K8s: Flow 4: Garbage Collection

    GC->>PG: Scan for expired jobs/files
    GC->>S3: Delete expired files
    GC->>Redis: Clean expired events
    GC->>K8s: Watch processor pods<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Note right of GC: Detect crashed processors
    GC->>PG: Re-enqueue orphaned jobs
    GC->>Redis: Re-enqueue to priority queue
